  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "From the outskirts of Subchain City, Quacksilver survived the Purge of '27 by scavenging amongst the ruins and perfecting his cyro-tech skills to protect himself and others on his level. He's always been a lone duck, trusting only his instincts and the cold comfort of his Featherguard Cyro. Now, he seeks to disrupt the DRIP cartel and bring balance to the blockchain, one icy blast at a time.",
    "class": "Cyro Disruptor",
    "name": "Quacksilver",
    "personality": "Cynical and resourceful, Quacksilver trusts no one and sees the worst in every situation, because it usually comes true. However, he has a soft spot for hatchlings and will go to great lengths to protect them, though he'll never admit it. Quacksilver's sense of humor is dry and sarcastic, often delivered with a deadpan expression.",
